{"type":"text","timestamp":1790400805200,"sessionID":"ses_f23d0c9e1ffeTk150h6x3h6OWn","part":{"id":"prt_0dc34393c001DjDVG5zMOZKs6i","messageID":"msg_0dc31f54a001iAm5pEI3c5ItVd","sessionID":"ses_f23d0c9e1ffeTk150h6x3h6OWn","type":"text","text":"The detection node needs to be initialized by the parent after stats are duplicated, while `TargetFinder` must connect safely during child-ready ordering. I’ll keep the requested API and resolve the actor’s `DetectRange` child directly in `_ready()` so signal hookup does not depend on the parent’s `@onready` fields already being initialized.","time":{"start":1790400805180,"end":1790400805183},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05411a7d15584cad016ab7592368408196b900800eb32ee10e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
