{"type":"text","timestamp":1790400833682,"sessionID":"ses_f23d0c9e1ffeTk150h6x3h6OWn","part":{"id":"prt_0dc34a882001ogMcWN4iRY81KO","messageID":"msg_0dc34394d001KGmVE1Z9GIcwez","sessionID":"ses_f23d0c9e1ffeTk150h6x3h6OWn","type":"text","text":"I’m adding the two custom node scripts, the opposing-team constant, and the scene wiring now. The scene will expose `col_shape`, `base_range_size`, `stats`, and `actor` through subresources/node references so the setup is editable and matches the requested exported properties.","time":{"start":1790400833666,"end":1790400833667},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05411a7d15584cad016ab75928ebf48196bfb66856b8aff064","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790400833727,"sessionID":"ses_f23d0c9e1ffeTk150h6x3h6OWn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_4jIfw8l3EPNmpIrQ8vFepGLz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd\n@@\n enum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n+\n+const TARGET := {Team.PLAYER: \"intruders\", Team.ENEMY: \"guards\"}\n \n const MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n*** Add File: /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n+class_name DetectRange\n+extends Area2D\n+\n+@export var col_shape: CollisionShape2D\n+@export var base_range_size: float = 32.0\n+@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n+\n+\n+func _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n+\tstats = value\n+\n+\tif not stats or not col_shape:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tcollision_layer = 4 * (stats.team + 1)\n+\tcollision_mask = 2 - stats.team\n+\tvar range_shape := CircleShape2D.new()\n+\trange_shape.radius = base_range_size * stats.attack_range\n+\tcol_shape.shape = range_shape\n*** Add File: /workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\n+class_name TargetFinder\n+extends Node\n+\n+signal targets_in_range_changed\n+\n+@export var actor: BattleUnit\n+var target: BattleUnit\n+var targets_in_range: Array[BattleUnit] = []\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tif not actor:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar detect_range: DetectRange = actor.get_node(\"DetectRange\")\n+\tdetect_range.area_entered.connect(_on_area_entered)\n+\tdetect_range.area_exited.connect(_on_area_exited)\n+\n+\n+func _on_area_entered(area: Area2D) -> void:\n+\tif area is BattleUnit:\n+\t\ttargets_in_range.append(area)\n+\t\ttargets_in_range_changed.emit()\n+\n+\n+func _on_area_exited(area: Area2D) -> void:\n+\tif area is BattleUnit:\n+\t\ttargets_in_range.erase(area)\n+\t\ttargets_in_range_changed.emit()\n+\n+\n+func find_target() -> void:\n+\ttarget = null\n+\tif not actor or not actor.stats:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar closest_distance := INF\n+\tfor node in get_tree().get_nodes_in_group(UnitStats.TARGET[actor.stats.team]):\n+\t\tif node is BattleUnit:\n+\t\t\tvar distance := actor.position.distance_squared_to(node.position)\n+\t\t\tif distance < closest_distance:\n+\t\t\t\tclosest_distance = distance\n+\t\t\t\ttarget = node\n+\n+\n+func has_target_in_range() -> bool:\n+\treturn not targets_in_range.is_empty()\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\n@@\n class_name BattleUnit\n extends Area2D\n \n @export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n+@onready var detect_range: DetectRange = $DetectRange\n+@onready var target_finder: TargetFinder = $TargetFinder\n@@\n \tstats = value.duplicate()\n \tcollision_layer = stats.team + 1\n+\tdetect_range.stats = stats\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]\n \n [ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n [ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_stats\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\" id=\"3_detect_range\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\" id=\"4_target_finder\"]\n@@\n [sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"1_body_shape\"]\n size = Vector2(24, 24)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"CircleShape2D\" id=\"2_range_shape\"]\n+radius = 128.0\n@@\n [node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\n shape = SubResource(\"1_body_shape\")\n+\n+[node name=\"DetectRange\" type=\"Area2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+collision_mask = 2\n+script = ExtResource(\"3_detect_range\")\n+col_shape = NodePath(\"CollisionShape2D\")\n+\n+[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\"DetectRange\"]\n+shape = SubResource(\"2_range_shape\")\n+\n+[node name=\"TargetFinder\" type=\"Node\" parent=\".\"]\n+script = ExtResource(\"4_target_finder\")\n+actor = NodePath(\"..\")\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd\nA workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\nA workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\nM workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\nM workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd\n+++ /workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd\n@@ -2,8 +2,10 @@\n extends Resource\n \n enum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n \n+const TARGET := {Team.PLAYER: \"intruders\", Team.ENEMY: \"guards\"}\n+\n const MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n \n @export var team: Team\n @export_range(1, MAX_ATTACK_RANGE) var attack_range: int = 1\n\nIndex: /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n+++ /workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@\n+class_name DetectRange\n+extends Area2D\n+\n+@export var col_shape: CollisionShape2D\n+@export var base_range_size: float = 32.0\n+@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n+\n+\n+func _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n+\tstats = value\n+\n+\tif not stats or not col_shape:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tcollision_layer = 4 * (stats.team + 1)\n+\tcollision_mask = 2 - stats.team\n+\tvar range_shape := CircleShape2D.new()\n+\trange_shape.radius = base_range_size * stats.attack_range\n+\tcol_shape.shape = range_shape\n\nIndex: /workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\n+++ /workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@\n+class_name TargetFinder\n+extends Node\n+\n+signal targets_in_range_changed\n+\n+@export var actor: BattleUnit\n+var target: BattleUnit\n+var targets_in_range: Array[BattleUnit] = []\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tif not actor:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar detect_range: DetectRange = actor.get_node(\"DetectRa